# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Explicitly publish the compact original inputs and validation results needed
# to reconstruct the ORCA-only tandem-paper pipeline.  These exceptions guard
# against future broad output/extension rules hiding scientific source data.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

